10 REM HELLO - PMD 85-2, IN TEXT AND IN LINES
20 GCLEAR
30 SCALE 0,100,0,100
40 REM ---- A DRAWN FRAME: THIS MACHINE HAS NO GRAPHICS CHARACTERS ----
50 MOVE 3,3
60 PLOT 97,3
70 PLOT 97,97
80 PLOT 3,97
90 PLOT 3,3
100 FOR I=1 TO 9
110 PRINT
120 NEXT I
130 REM ---- INK(N) IS THE WHOLE COLOUR MODEL: PLAIN, BLINK, DIM, BOTH ----
140 FOR N=0 TO 7
150 PRINT INK(N-INT(N/4)*4);TAB(16);"HELLO PMD 85!"
160 BEEP
170 PAUSE 2
180 NEXT N
190 PRINT
200 PRINT INK(0);TAB(19);"BASICALLY"
210 PAUSE 20
220 GOTO 20
